{"id":"vod_md_4409","vodId":"4409","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"向山进发第二季","name_cn":"向山进发第二季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230907-1/be9e213e0ba55e67a81611523e2c6d16.jpg"},"summary":"故事以女高中生进行登山活动为主题，讲述了喜欢室内活动并患有恐高症的主角葵，在重遇喜欢户外活动的青梅竹马朋友日向后，因希望能像儿时在山顶看日出，而再次进行登山活动。「向山进发」是由曾担任PC游戏「交响乐之雨」角色设计并负责其原画的插画家Shiro(しろ)所绘的漫画作品，自 月刊漫画杂志「Comic Earth Star」2011年9月号上开始连载，至今已推出了5卷单行本。作品以女子高中生登山为主题，讲述了以喜好室内活动并且有恐高症的主人公雪村葵、有着户外活动意向的青梅竹马日向的再会作为契机，为了能再次看到年幼时看过的山顶日出而登山的物语。TV动画第1季于今年1月至3月间播出，每集长度仅为5分钟，此次第2季确定是半年番并且每集长度为15分钟，相信对于喜爱本作的朋友来说是一件值得欢呼的事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-07 08:00:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/XyyJ5fiQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/nKQXQ2gs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/Pjvya77M/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/dA6lhUNv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/zeln45ak/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/uy6J5djk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/sZMay7N8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/tPEKebLz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/c0BHix08/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/DxSvYGbt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/WAAlclFh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/E6LxstH2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/qWfCU2B8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/bOcW7823/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"ht